version 1.0.2
New Features
1.Added AI command generation. Supports one-click CMD generation from Chinese/English descriptions, with local Ollama offline support and compatibility with mainstream remote LLMs. AI settings can be imported and exported.
2. Added Auto Create intelligent splitting. Automatically parses command lines into directories, parameters and fixed text to improve editing efficiency.
3. Persistent sessions support manual command input and auto history saving. Session records can be quickly added to the command set for easier debugging.
Optimizations & Bug Fixes
1. Optimized path parameter selection, supporting both file and folder picking.
2. Fixed terminal output garbled characters and optimized real-time output streaming for smoother experience.
3. Optimized command persistence. New commands are automatically saved without manual operation to prevent data loss.
4. Improved settings page layout with scroll support, fully usable in small window sizes.
